Jade for Sunrise

This is an adapted version of Jade (https://github.com/Snownee/Jade) by Snownee, version 26.3.5 for Minecraft 26.3,
shared under the same licence, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International (see LICENSE).

Changes: Jade's behaviour rewritten in Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no original code runs); its assets
(language files, GUI sprites, themes) are included unchanged under assets/jade. src/facts.rs is generated from
Minecraft's own block data.

An unofficial port, not made or endorsed by the original authors. Noncommercial use only; adaptations must keep this
licence.
